  "notes": [
    "A later owner-confirmed A329T 3CH auto-event card uses T/PT for telephoto. Its Parking-folder clips are motion-triggered and its RO-folder parking clips are impact-triggered; low bitrate alone must not be interpreted as continuous parking recording. Parking subtype depends on the camera setting and cannot always be determined from timing alone.",
    "The owner-confirmed 1CH front-only V2.2_260815 submission is separate from historical 3CH evidence. Quality, HDR, configured parking mode and capture cadence were not reported. App-reported codec summaries are not per-file codec verification; parking classifications are not confirmed settings."
